@startuml lld-us7-sequence
title LLD-US7 View Current account details: sequence diagram
skinparam monochrome true
autonumber
participant Browser
participant AccountService
participant CbsAdapter
participant CurrentAccount
Browser -> AccountService : GET /accounts/{id}
AccountService -> CbsAdapter : details(id)
AccountService -> CurrentAccount : available()
AccountService --> Browser : details
@enduml